# --- Personal data — THIS REPO IS PUBLIC. See "This repo is public" in CLAUDE.md.
# Raw database dumps: health, finance, everything.
analysis-bundles/

# Deny-by-default inside analysis/: the live docs accumulate real health data and
# identifying detail, so a new file here is ignored unless explicitly allowed
# below. ANALYZE.md is method only; the templates are the tracked shape of
# CONTEXT.md / FINDINGS.md, which are gitignored. If you add a doc that genuinely
# belongs in the repo, add a negation for it — deliberately, not by reflex.
analysis/*
!analysis/ANALYZE.md
!analysis/*.template.md

# Scratch notes. plan.md previously held a family member's name and finance
# details; assume anything in this shape is personal.
plan.md
notes.md
scratch/
